# Database (Prisma + PostgreSQL)

- Models live in [schema.prisma](mdc:schema.prisma) only (not as entities in `main.wasp`)
- Provider: **postgresql**; `DATABASE_URL` in `.env.server`
- Run Postgres with **Docker Compose** (`docker compose up -d db`); `DATABASE_URL` in `.env.server`
- After schema edits: `wasp db migrate-dev`
- Define `@relation`s in Prisma; categories/transactions/accounts as in README

## Operations + entities

- List every Entity an operation needs in `main.wasp` (`entities: [...]`) so `context.entities.X` works
- Import entity **types** from `wasp/entities`
- Import Prisma enum **values** from `@prisma/client` (not `wasp/entities`)

## Seed

- Category defaults: seed file once on first run → Postgres (not JSON as live source of truth)
